{"seq":1,"slug":"grid-slot-inventory","title":"网格与槽位背包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/inventory-systems/grid-slot-inventory","wordCount":1293,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"网格与槽位背包\">网格与槽位背包</h1><p>同样是「打开背包」，《暗黑破坏神》让你面对一片方格、大件武器横占三格逼你整理，《原神》给你一个自动堆叠的无限列表。这两种形态背后是两种截然不同的容器算法与玩法哲学。本篇把 <a href=\"../foundations/inventory-data-structures\">背包数据结构</a> 里点到的两种容器落到交互层：槽位背包怎么处理拖拽与排序，网格背包怎么处理矩形装箱与旋转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>槽位与网格的根本差异在于「一件物品占据多少空间」。槽位背包里每件物品恰好占一格，背包容量就是格子数；网格背包里物品有矩形足迹，容量是一片二维空间，于是放置变成装箱问题，整理本身成为玩法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[拾取物品] --&gt; B{背包是网格还是槽位?}&#10;  B --&gt;|槽位·一物一格| C[找首个空槽或可堆叠堆]&#10;  C --&gt; D[放入·结束]&#10;  B --&gt;|网格·矩形足迹| E[遍历锚点找可容纳矩形]&#10;  E --&gt; F{找到位置?}&#10;  F --&gt;|否·尝试旋转| G[旋转90度再找]&#10;  F --&gt;|是| H[标记占用矩形·放入]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  G -.仍失败.-&gt; I[背包已满·拾取失败]\">flowchart TD\n  A[拾取物品] --&gt; B{背包是网格还是槽位?}\n  B --&gt;|槽位·一物一格| C[找首个空槽或可堆叠堆]\n  C --&gt; D[放入·结束]\n  B --&gt;|网格·矩形足迹| E[遍历锚点找可容纳矩形]\n  E --&gt; F{找到位置?}\n  F --&gt;|否·尝试旋转| G[旋转90度再找]\n  F --&gt;|是| H[标记占用矩形·放入]\n  G --&gt; H\n  G -.仍失败.-&gt; I[背包已满·拾取失败]</pre><p>槽位背包的拾取是一维问题，网格背包的拾取是二维装箱。前者实现简单、对玩家认知负担低；后者制造稀缺与抉择，把「带什么、舍什么」变成核心张力。选择哪种，取决于你想让背包成为透明的容器还是玩法的一部分。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>槽位背包</th>\n<th>网格背包</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物品占用</td>\n<td>恒为一格</td>\n<td>矩形足迹（如 1×3、2×2）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>放置算法</td>\n<td>找空槽 O(n)</td>\n<td>二维装箱 O(W·H·w·h)，可位掩码加速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旋转</td>\n<td>无意义</td>\n<td>常见，90° 切换足迹宽高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整理玩法</td>\n<td>弱（排序/筛选）</td>\n<td>强（俄罗斯方块式空间管理）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>玩家认知负担</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表作</td>\n<td>多数 MMORPG、原神</td>\n<td>暗黑、流放之路、塔科夫</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"槽位背包-拖拽-排序与自动整理\">槽位背包：拖拽、排序与自动整理</h2><p>槽位背包的核心交互是拖拽：把第 i 格的物品拖到第 j 格。这看似简单，却要处理四种情况——目标空（移动）、目标同类可堆叠（合并）、目标同类满堆（保持原位）、目标异类（交换）。把这四种情况显式写清，是健壮背包 UI 的基本功：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public void DragTo(int from, int to) {&#10;    var a = slots[from]; var b = slots[to];&#10;    if (b.IsEmpty)                    { slots[to] = a; slots[from] = Empty; }   // 移动&#10;    else if (a.TemplateId == b.TemplateId &amp;&amp; a.Template.MaxStack &gt; 1) {&#10;        int room = b.Template.MaxStack - b.Count;                              // 合并&#10;        int moved = Math.Min(room, a.Count);&#10;        b.Count += moved; a.Count -= moved;&#10;        if (a.Count == 0) slots[from] = Empty;&#10;    } else                            { slots[from] = b; slots[to] = a; }       // 交换&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public void DragTo(int from, int to) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var a = slots[from]; var b = slots[to];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (b.IsEmpty)                    { slots[to] = a; slots[from] = Empty; }   // 移动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    else if (a.TemplateId == b.TemplateId &#x26;&#x26; a.Template.MaxStack > 1) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int room = b.Template.MaxStack - b.Count;                              // 合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int moved = Math.Min(room, a.Count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        b.Count += moved; a.Count -= moved;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (a.Count == 0) slots[from] = Empty;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else                            { slots[from] = b; slots[to] = a; }       // 交换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>自动整理（一键排序）是槽位背包的招牌功能：按类型、品质、数量重排，并把零散的同类堆合并。它本质是先把所有非空槽收集出来，按排序键稳定排序，再按贪心策略重新堆叠回去。要注意排序必须稳定，否则每次整理同一背包会得到不同顺序，玩家会困惑。堆叠合并的细则——上限、拆分、部分堆——交由 <a href=\"stacking-equipment\">堆叠与装备栏</a> 统一处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网格背包-矩形装箱与位掩码加速\">网格背包：矩形装箱与位掩码加速</h2><p>网格背包把容器建模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W \\times H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的占用位图。一件足迹为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w \\times h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 的物品要放入，必须找到一个锚点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(r, c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，使得从该点起的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w \\times h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 矩形区域全空。朴素算法对每个锚点扫描整个矩形，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(W \\cdot H \\cdot w \\cdot h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，对几十格背包够用，但对塔科夫那种上百格的容器需要优化。</p>\n<p>经典加速是位掩码：把每一行的占用状态压成一个整数（第 c 位为 1 表示占用）。判断从第 c 列起连续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 格是否全空，只需检查掩码的某段是否为 0，用一次移位与按位与完成，把行内扫描从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。多行则对涉及的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 行各做一次：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// row[r] 是第 r 行的占用位掩码；判断 (r,c) 起 w×h 是否全空&#10;bool CanPlace(int r, int c, int w, int h) {&#10;    long need = (((1L &lt;&lt; w) - 1) &lt;&lt; c);   // c 起连续 w 个 1 的掩码&#10;    for (int dr = 0; dr &lt; h; dr++)&#10;        if ((row[r + dr] &amp; need) != 0) return false;  // 该行该段有占用&#10;    return true;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// row[r] 是第 r 行的占用位掩码；判断 (r,c) 起 w×h 是否全空</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>bool CanPlace(int r, int c, int w, int h) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    long need = (((1L &#x3C;&#x3C; w) - 1) &#x3C;&#x3C; c);   // c 起连续 w 个 1 的掩码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (int dr = 0; dr &#x3C; h; dr++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if ((row[r + dr] &#x26; need) != 0) return false;  // 该行该段有占用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>放置后把 <code>need</code> 按位或进对应各行即完成占用标记，移除则按位清零。旋转就是交换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 再重试。这套位运算让网格背包即便在大容量、频繁拾取时也保持流畅。网格制造的空间稀缺，与 <a href=\"weight-encumbrance\">负重与容量约束</a> 的重量稀缺是两种正交的容量设计，许多硬核生存游戏同时使用二者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型与混合方案\">选型与混合方案</h2><p>槽位与网格不是非此即彼。大量现代游戏采用混合：装备与大件走槽位或网格，材料货币走 <a href=\"../foundations/inventory-data-structures\">背包数据结构</a> 里的字典池，在 UI 上拼成统一界面。选型主要看你想给玩家多少「管理摩擦」——休闲与移动端倾向零摩擦的自动堆叠槽位列表，硬核生存与 ARPG 倾向高摩擦的网格。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[确定目标玩法摩擦] --&gt; B{想让整理成为玩法?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否·透明容器| C[自动堆叠槽位列表]&#10;  B --&gt;|是·空间抉择| D[二维网格 + 旋转]&#10;  C --&gt; E[材料货币用字典池]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[UI 层拼成统一背包]\">graph TD\n  A[确定目标玩法摩擦] --&gt; B{想让整理成为玩法?}\n  B --&gt;|否·透明容器| C[自动堆叠槽位列表]\n  B --&gt;|是·空间抉择| D[二维网格 + 旋转]\n  C --&gt; E[材料货币用字典池]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[UI 层拼成统一背包]</pre><p>无论哪种，背包的视觉呈现、拖拽手感、整理反馈都属于 UI/UX 层面的打磨，本篇只到算法为止，交互设计的更广议题见 <a href=\"../../game-ui-ux/hud-menus/inventory-systems\">游戏 UI/UX 的背包系统</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>槽位背包一物一格，拾取是一维找空位；网格背包有矩形足迹，拾取是二维装箱，整理成为玩法。</li>\n<li>槽位背包的核心是拖拽的四种情况（移动/合并/保持/交换）与稳定排序的一键整理。</li>\n<li>网格背包用每行位掩码把放置判断从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>W</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(W)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，旋转即交换足迹宽高。</li>\n<li>槽位低摩擦、网格高摩擦，主流做法是混合——装备走槽位/网格、资源走字典池，UI 拼合。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两种容器的底层结构见 <a href=\"../foundations/inventory-data-structures\">背包数据结构</a>；堆叠细则见 <a href=\"stacking-equipment\">堆叠与装备栏</a>；重量稀缺见 <a href=\"weight-encumbrance\">负重与容量约束</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：背包交互的 UX 打磨见 <a href=\"../../game-ui-ux/hud-menus/inventory-systems\">游戏 UI/UX</a>；网格装箱与 <a href=\"../../procedural-content-generation/terrain-space/dungeon-maze\">程序化内容生成</a> 的空间布局算法同源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"网格与槽位背包","id":"网格与槽位背包"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"槽位背包：拖拽、排序与自动整理","id":"槽位背包-拖拽-排序与自动整理"},{"level":2,"text":"网格背包：矩形装箱与位掩码加速","id":"网格背包-矩形装箱与位掩码加速"},{"level":2,"text":"选型与混合方案","id":"选型与混合方案"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实例与模板分离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/foundations/item-instance-vs-template"},"next":{"title":"堆叠与装备栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/inventory-systems/stacking-equipment"}}